  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Drain sweetcorn. Drain and rinse lentils.\n• Finely chop brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic. Grate carrot.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cc548e7b2ec1b120a80/step-5ff21900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion, carrot and corn, stirring, until softened, 5-6 mins.\n• Add garlic, Nan’s special seasoning and All-American spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in lentils, the brown sugar, half the passata, a splash of water and the butter and cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cc548e7b2ec1b120a80/step-ef82e610.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to medium-high.\n• Lay mini flour tortillas on a flat surface. Divide lentil filling between tortillas (about 1/2 cup each). Roll up tightly and place, seam-side down, in a baking dish, ensuring they fit snugly.\n• Pour the remaining passata over rolled tortillas. Sprinkle with cheese and grill until warmed through and cheese is golden, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cc548e7b2ec1b120a80/step-4d370e20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide enchiladas between plates to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cc548e7b2ec1b120a80/step-49d3b630.jpeg"
    }
  ]
